msgstr "Haiwezi kusasisha usajili: proksi ya HTTP haifanyi kazi!"

msgid "Subscriptions reloaded."
msgstr "Usajili umeonyeshwa upya."

msgid "If SusiDNS is configured to publish your Router address book, the entries will appear in your Published address book and saved to a hosts.txt file for sharing."
msgstr "Ikiwa SusiDNS imesanidiwa kuchapisha kitabu chenu cha anwani cha routeri, vielimu vitatokea katika kitabu chenu cha anwani kilichochapishwa na kuhifadhiwa katika faili ya hosts.txt kwa kushiriki."

msgid "Published Addressbook"
msgstr "Kitabu cha Anwani Kilichochapishwa"

msgid "To configure SusiDNS to push your Router address book to your Published address book, set 'should_publish=true' on the configuration page."
msgstr "Ili kusanidi SusiDNS kusukuma kitabu chenu cha anwani cha routeri hadi kwenye kitabu chenu cha anwani kilichochapishwa, weka 'should_publish=true' kwenye kurasa ya mipangilio."

msgid "All hosts derived from subscriptions will appear in this address book, in addition to any you manually add here or to your Master address book."
msgstr "Mashine zote zinazotokana na usajili zitaonekana katika kitabu hiki cha anwani, pamoja na zote unazoongeza hapa kwa mkono au kwenye kitabu chenu cha anwani kuu."

msgid "Router Addressbook"
msgstr "Kitabu cha Anwani cha Routeri"

msgid "Hosts you manually add here will never be published. You can also add aliases to hosts in other address books here."
msgstr "Mashine unazoongeza hapa kwa mkono hazitachapishwa kamwe. Unaweza pia kuongeza majina lingine ya mashine katika vitabu vingine vya anwani hapa."

msgid "Private Addressbook"
msgstr "Kitabu cha Anwani Bina"

msgid "Local Records"
msgstr "Rekodi za Ndani"

msgid "I2P applications (including the HTTP proxy) use the hosts in your local address books to resolve .i2p hostnames."
msgstr "Programu za I2P (pamoja na proksi ya HTTP) zinatumia mashine katika vitabu vyenu vya anwani vya ndani kutatua majina ya mashine ya .i2p."

msgid "Additional subscriptions can be found in the FAQ section of the Router help page."
msgstr "Usajili zaidi zinaweza kupatikana katika sekhsen ya Maswali Yanayoulizwa Mara kwa Mara kwenye kurasa ya msaada ya Routeri."

msgid "Subscriptions"
msgstr "Usajili"

msgid "Hosts sourced from your subscriptions are added to your Router address book, and are automatically synced (by default every 12 hours)."
msgstr "Mashine zinazopatikana kutoka usajili wenu zinaongezwa katika kitabu chenu cha anwani cha routeri, na zinasawazishwa kwa moja kwa moja (kwa default kila saa 12)."

msgid "Configure Subscriptions"
msgstr "Sanidi Usajili"

msgid "If you manually add hosts here, they will be included your Published address book (if configured)."
msgstr "Ikiwa unaongeza mashine hapa kwa mkono, zitaongezwa katika kitabu chenu cha anwani kilichochapishwa (ikiwa imesanidiwa)."

msgid "Master Addressbook"
msgstr "Kitabu cha Anwani Kuu"

msgid "Searchable by"
msgstr "Inayotafutika kwa"

msgid "I2P applications"
msgstr "Programu za I2P"

msgid "The Master, Router and Private address books collectively serve as the DNS authority for I2P applications."
msgstr "Vitabu vya anwani kuu, cha routeri na cha bina kwa pamoja vinahudumia kama mamlaka ya DNS kwa programu za I2P."

msgid "Optional,"
msgstr "Si lazima,"

msgid "for websites"
msgstr "kwa tovuti"

msgid "If you configure SusiDNS to publish your Router address book, it will export a hosts.txt file containing all the hosts (by default to the root of your eepsite)."
msgstr "Ikiwa unasanidi SusiDNS kuchapisha kitabu chenu cha anwani cha routeri, itatoa faili ya hosts.txt yenye mashine zote (kwa default hadi mzizi wa eepsite yenu)."

msgid "Addresses manually added to your Master address book will merge with your Router address book."
msgstr "Anwani zilizoongezwa kwa mkono katika kitabu chenu cha anwani kuu zitaunganishwa na kitabu chenu cha anwani cha routeri."

msgid "Hosts you receive from your subscriptions will merge with your Router address book."
msgstr "Mashine unayopokea kutoka usajili wenu zitaunganishwa na kitabu chenu cha anwani cha routeri."

