msgid "File and directory paths here are relative to the addressbook's working directory, which is normally ~/.i2p/addressbook/ (Linux) or %LOCALAPPDATA%\\I2P\\addressbook\\ (Windows)."
msgstr "Njia za faili na katalogi hapa ni za kuhusu katalogi ya kazi ya kitabu cha anwani, ambayo kawaida ni ~/.i2p/addressbook/ (Linux) au %LOCALAPPDATA%\\I2P\\addressbook\\ (Windows)."

msgid "If you want to manually add lines to an addressbook, add them to the private or master addressbooks."
msgstr "Ikiwa unataka kuongeza mistari kwa mkono kwenye kitabu cha anwani, ongeza kwenye vitabu vya anwani vya bina au vya kuu."

msgid "The router addressbook and the published addressbook are updated by the addressbook application."
msgstr "Kitabu cha anwani cha routeri na kitabu cha anwani kilichochapishwa husasishwa na programu ya kitabu cha anwani."

msgid "When you publish your addressbook, ALL destinations from the master and router addressbooks appear there."
msgstr "Unapochapisha kitabu chenu cha anwani, MALENGO YOTE kutoka vitabu vya anwani vya kuu na vya routeri huonekana pale."

msgid "Use the private addressbook for private destinations, these are not published."
msgstr "Tumia kitabu cha anwani cha bina kwa malengo ya bina, hayajachapishwa."

