msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Utangulizi"

msgid "What is the addressbook?"
msgstr "Kitabu cha anwani ni nini?"

msgid "The addressbook application is part of your I2P installation."
msgstr "Programu ya kitabu cha anwani ni sehemu ya usakinishaji wako wa I2P."

msgid "It regularly updates your hosts.txt file from distributed sources or \"subscriptions\"."
msgstr "Inasasisha kwa kawaida faili yako ya hosts.txt kutoka vyanzo vilivyousambaza au \"usajili\"."

msgid "Subscribing to additional sites is easy, just add them to your <a href=\"subscriptions\">subscriptions</a> file."
msgstr "Kujisajili kwa tovuti zaidi ni rahisi, ongeza tu kwenye faili yako ya <a href=\"subscriptions\">usajili</a>."

msgid "For more information on naming in I2P, see <a href=\"http://i2p-projekt.i2p/naming.html\" target=_blank>the overview</a>."
msgstr "Kwa taarifa zaidi kuhusu majina kwenye I2P, angalia <a href=\"http://i2p-projekt.i2p/naming.html\" target=_blank>muhtasari</a>."

msgid "How does the addressbook application work?"
msgstr "Programu ya kitabu cha anwani inafanya kazi vipi?"

msgid "The addressbook application regularly polls your subscriptions and merges their content into your \"router\" address book."
msgstr "Programu ya kitabu cha anwani inauliza kwa kawaida usajili wenu na kuyakamilisha yaliyomo yake kwenye kitabu chenu cha anwani cha \"routeri\"."

msgid "Then it merges your \"master\" address book into the router address book as well."
msgstr "Kisha ndiyo inakamilisha kitabu chenu cha anwani cha \"kuu\" kwenye kitabu cha anwani cha routeri pia."

msgid "If configured, the router address book is now written to the \"published\" address book, which will be publicly available if you are running an eepsite."
msgstr "Ikiwa imesanidiwa, kitabu cha anwani cha routeri sasa huandikwa kwenye kitabu cha anwani cha \"kilichochapishwa\", ambacho kitapatikana kwa umma ikiwa unaendesha eepsite."

msgid "The router also uses a private address book, which is not merged or published."
msgstr "Routeri pia inatumia kitabu cha anwani cha bina, ambacho hakuunganishwi wala hakichapishwi."

msgid "Hosts in the private address book can be accessed by you but their addresses are never distributed to others."
msgstr "Mashine katika kitabu cha anwani cha bina zinaweza kufikiliwa nawe, lakini anwani zao hazikusambazwe kamwe kwa wengine."

msgid "The private address book can also be used for aliases of hosts in your other address books."
msgstr "Kitabu cha anwani cha bina pia kinaweza kutumika kwa majina lingine ya mashine katika vitabu vyako vingine vya anwani."

msgid "subscription log"
msgstr "kumbukumbu ya usajili"

msgid "Subscription Log"
msgstr "Kumbukumbu ya Usajili"

msgid "Most recent (excluding bad domains)"
msgstr "Zilizo hivi karibuni (bila kuhesabiwa domaini mbaya)"

msgid "subscriptions"
msgstr "usajili"

msgid "The subscription file contains a list of i2p URLs."
msgstr "Faili ya usajili ina orodha ya URL za i2p."

msgid "The addressbook application regularly checks this list for new eepsites."
msgstr "Programu ya kitabu cha anwani inaangalia orodha hii kwa kawaida kwa eepsites mpya."

msgid "Those URLs refer to published hosts.txt files."
msgstr "URL hizo zinarejerekea faili za hosts.txt zilizochapishwa."

msgid "See the FAQ for a list of subscription URLs."
msgstr "Angalia MYKM kwa orodha ya URL za usajili."
